      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Reference: briareus-windows. Other clients match this structure, differing only as noted here.\nEach provider row in the sidebar has a dot and tag chips: the binary, 'inactive', 'own login', 'custom endpoint'. A new unsaved row reads 'New provider' / 'not saved yet'.\nBinary choices: claude (Claude Code), codex (Codex), grok (Grok), opencode. Mode (Login / API token) is offered only for binaries that support both; grok shows 'grok signs in with its own login; it takes no API token.'\nWhen codex logs in, the device code appears with a Copy button. When claude logs in, a 'Code from the browser' field and a Finish button appear.\nThe Status tab exists only once the provider is saved. Its quota bars use the labels the provider sends back.\nA new provider shows only Save; ⧉ clone and 🗑 delete are icon-only buttons.\nRegion names (sidebar, canvas, raise, sunken) are the theme.* roles; widths and margins are layout.* in tokens/. Greys only, on purpose.",
      "originalText": "Reference: briareus-windows. Other clients match this structure, differing only as noted here.\nEach provider row in the sidebar has a dot and tag chips: the binary, 'inactive', 'own login', 'custom endpoint'. A new unsaved row reads 'New provider' / 'not saved yet'.\nBinary choices: claude (Claude Code), codex (Codex), grok (Grok), opencode. Mode (Login / API token) is offered only for binaries that support both; grok shows 'grok signs in with its own login; it takes no API token.'\nWhen codex logs in, the device code appears with a Copy button. When claude logs in, a 'Code from the browser' field and a Finish button appear.\nThe Status tab exists only once the provider is saved. Its quota bars use the labels the provider sends back.\nA new provider shows only Save; ⧉ clone and 🗑 delete are icon-only buttons.\nRegion names (sidebar, canvas, raise, sunken) are the theme.* roles; widths and margins are layout.* in tokens/. Greys only, on purpose.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
  ],
